- @page_title = "Join the Team"
.container
  .row
    .span7
      %h1.title= @page_title
      #mission
      %p
        Action.IO is revolutionizing the way the world builds applications by moving your development runtime to the cloud. We're looking for remarkable people to help us effect the next paradigm shift in programming.
      %p
        Action.IO was founded in June of 2012 and has offices in Palo Alto, California and Singapore.

      %article#jobs
        #jpost
          %h3 Dev Ops Engineer
          %p.desc
            Dev Ops are the heart of the Action.IO platform. You're an automation wizard, you've rube goldberg'ed your entire morning routine, and you're looking to take those skills elsewhere.

          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li
                BS or greater in Computer Science or related quantitative field
              %li
                You are the king of AWS (EC2+EBS+S3)
              %li
                Experience administering large scale production server environments
              %li
                Familiarity with common open source web service infrastructure:  Nginx, HAProxy, Redis, MySQL, etc;
              %li
                Ability to identify and smash performance bottlenecks
              %li
                Experience with monitoring systems and configuration management tools like Chef & Puppet

          %p.actions
            To apply, please send your CV & github profile to
            %a{ :href=> "mailto:jobs@action.io?subject=DevOps%20Engineer" } jobs@action.io

        #jpost
          %h3 Software Engineer
          %p.desc
            Want to know the secret to our kickass product? We use Action.IO to build Action.IO.
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li
                BS or greater in Computer Science or related quantitative field
              %li
                Solid knowledge of Ruby, Python, and new Javascript Frameworks like Knockout.js, Backbone.js or Ember.js.
              %li
                A passion for cloud computing and optimization
              %li
                Obsessive about attention to detail
              %li
                Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of whats possible


          %p.actions
            To apply, please send your CV & github profile to
            %a{ :href=> "mailto:hello@action.io?subject=Software%20Engineer" } jobs@actionio

    .span4.offset1#sideinfo
      %article
        %p
          = image_tag "home-index/world.png"
        %h3 About Action.IO
        %p
          %ul
            %li Founded June 2012
            %li Offices in Palo Alto & Singapore
            %li We develop Action.IO using Action.IO

        %hr{:style => "margin: 1em 0 1em"}

        %h3 Action Perks
        %p
          %ul
            %li Gym Stipend
            %li Beer (or Juice) Fridays
            %li Hipster Fixed-gear Bike Signing Bonus
            %li Sweet Action Hoodie
            %li Weekly Company Hackathons

        %hr{:style => "margin: 1em 0 1em"}

        %h3 Team Action
        %p
          %ul.team-members
            %li
              =link_to image_tag("assets/team/aj50.jpeg"), team_path
            %li
              =link_to image_tag("assets/team/peter50.jpeg"), team_path
            %li
              =link_to image_tag("assets/team/arun50.jpeg"), team_path


